    verification receiptAtMeansTheSameInBothReceiptsStandupGate : Test { :>> id = "ad9b19a5-769f-4749-b2a7-e552e2ea883c"; :>> title = "Sprint 667 standup gate"; :>> createdAt = "2026-09-11"; :>> createdBy = "claudeOpus5"; :>> method = VerificationMethod::inspect; :>> procedureText = "Order: patch suite.rs through scripts/textpatch.py (field, parser, renderer, stub, done_receipt, the pair) with the anchors named from the read; patch the skill's SUITE clause; patch facts.py; record D0442 with the marker and this sprint with keel new sprint --fill; rebuild once the sprint 666 land's cargo has exited (the land compiles from the working tree and include_dir embeds .engine, so no source or .engine edit lands while it runs); refresh keel-serve.exe; then the verifier (test-verify, touched run detached, pair = suite.rs unit tests a_done_receipt_is_stamped_when_written_and_carries_the_run_seconds and a_running_stub_is_stamped_at_its_start_with_no_seconds) and the recorder from its receipt only (D0425), evidence passed WITHOUT the receipt marker (issue476)."; }
